#: processes/l2-dak-authoring.bpmn:66
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The one gate every authored track must clear before assembly: a \"no\" here does not return to the specific task that erred but loops back through Gateway_AuthorMerge into the fork itself, so this lane's judgement — not the analyst's — decides whether personas, BPMN, DMN, data dictionary and indicators all get revisited together."
msgstr ""

#: processes/l2-dak-authoring.bpmn:83
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Turn the scope into beans on the shared work plan — one per DAK component, since a DAK is completed component by component. beans create is not idempotent: check for an existing bean before every create, or a re-run duplicates the plan."
msgstr ""

